this sort of thing.","start":47.28,"end":51.84,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-065-005","sourceId":"b2-065-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"A policeman approached Jimmy and told him he ought to have gone along a side street as Jumbo was holding up the traffic.","start":53.28,"end":61.91,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-065-006","sourceId":"b2-065-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Though Jimmy agreed to go at once, Jumbo refused to move.","start":63.7,"end":68.94,"score":0.962,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-065-007","sourceId":"b2-065-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Fifteen policemen had to push very hard to get him off the main street.","start":70.14,"end":75.89,"score":0.975,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-065-008","sourceId":"b2-065-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"The police had a difficult time, but they were most amused.","start":76.98,"end":81.6,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-065-009","sourceId":"b2-065-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'Jumbo must weigh a few tons,' said a policeman afterwards, 'so it was fortunate that we didn't have to carry him.","start":82.99,"end":92.15,"score":0.985,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-065-010","sourceId":"b2-065-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Of course, we should arrest him, but as he has a good record, we shall let him off this time.'","start":93.03,"end":99.73,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]}]}
